<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">{a, a, a} */</font></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></center>
<font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>&nbsp;<font face=3D"Times=
 New Roman,Times"></font>
<p><a name=3D"7.1"></a><b><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">7.1 Parallel
Expressions</font></b>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">fork ... join are used for cncurre=
nt
expression assignments</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>
</p><p><i><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">fork ... join example</font>=
</i>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>&nbsp;
</p><center><table width=3D"80%" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" border=
=3D"1" bgcolor=3D"#ffffff">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<pre><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">initial
&nbsp;&nbsp; begin : block
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; fork
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; //This waits=
 for the first event a
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; //or b to occu=
r.
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; @a disable blo=
ck
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; @b disable blo=
ck

&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // reset at ab=
solute time 20
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #20 reset =3D=
 1;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // data at abs=
olute time 100
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #100 data =3D=
 0;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; // data at abs=
olute time 120
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; #120 data =3D=
 1;
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; join
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; end</font></pre>
</td>
</tr>
