<p><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">How Synopsys handles <a tppabs=3D"h=
ttp://ee.ucd.ie/~finbarr/verilog/block_non_block.html" href=3D"block_non_bl=
ock.html">blocking
and non-blocking assignments...</a></font>
