</p><hr width=3D"100%"><a name=3D"12.1"></a><b><font face=3D"Times New Roma=
n,Times">12.1
Gate Delays</font></b><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>
<p><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">The delays allow for modelling of
rise time, fall time and turn off delays for the gates. Each of these delay
types may be in the min:typ:max format. The order of the delays are #(trise,
tfall, tturn-off).</font><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>
</p><p><i><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">For example:</font></i>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>&nbsp;
</p><center><table width=3D"80%" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" border=
=3D"1" bgcolor=3D"#ffffff">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<pre><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">nand #(6:7:8, 5:6:7, 12:16:19) (o=
ut, a, b);&nbsp;</font></pre>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></center>
<font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>&nbsp;
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>&nbsp;
<center><table width=3D"80%" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" border=3D"=
1" bgcolor=3D"#ffffff">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<center><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">Delay</font></center>
</td>

<td>
<center><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">Model</font></center>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">#(delay)</font></td>

<td><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">min:typ:max delay</font></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">#(delay,delay)</font></td>

<td><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">rise time delay, fall time delay
each delay can be with min:typ:max</font></td>
</tr>

