 New Roman,Times"></font>
<p><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">For trireg, the delay of the capaci=
tive
network is modelled using the rise time delay, fall time delay and</font>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">charge decay. For example,</font>
<br><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times"></font>&nbsp;
</p><center><table width=3D"80%" cellspacing=3D"0" cellpadding=3D"0" border=
=3D"1" bgcolor=3D"#ffffff">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<pre><font face=3D"Times New Roman,Times">trireg (large) #(0,1,9) capacitor
//charge strength is large
// decay with tr =3D 0, tf =3D 1, tdecay =3D 9</font></pre>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></center>
